# OWNERSHIP=Claude
# The Docker build context (#110), as an allowlist: everything is left out
# (data/ alone is 17 GB; .git, books/, *.exe and *.pgn with it) except what
# `make ascaniusfish_uci gui/ascaniusfish_gui` reads and the runtime copies.
*
!Makefile
!ascaniusfish.hpp
!ascaniusfish_2.hpp
!ascaniusfish_uci.cpp
!lib/
!src/
!gui/
!tools/
!third_party/
!weights/
!nets/

# Inside those: build output from a local make, never sent.
gui/ascaniusfish_gui
third_party/gaviota/obj/
third_party/gaviota/libgtb.a
**/*.exe
**/*.pgn
**/*.tsv
